# What Unity makes of the project when it opens it.
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/
*.csproj
*.sln

# Unity's, which Saruhashi's .gitignore ignores as Visual Studio's: the packages the project uses, and the metadata that
# gives each asset its GUID.
!/Packages/
!/Packages/manifest.json
!/Packages/packages-lock.json
!*.meta

# Saruhashi's assemblies, which building Aigamo.Saruhashi.Unity copies here.
/Assets/Plugins/
/Assets/Plugins.meta
